---
kind: lore
id: bonds.aria
title: Aria, the Starcaller (SSR)
---

/* One file per hero: everything this character says outside the main story.
   Summon intro and dupe line, home-screen tap, birthday, bond stories r1-r3. */

<beat id="ariaIntro" on="summon" target="hero.aria" once="user" priority="10">
  @aria{emotion="surprised"}: Oh! I fell. From up there. That was the sky, right?
  @aria{emotion="happy"}: I'm Aria. I call stars. Usually they answer. Tonight, you did.
</beat>

<beat id="ariaDupe" on="summon" target="hero.aria" once="false" priority="3" when="holds(owned(aria)) && occasion.payload.copies <= 6">
  @aria{emotion="shy"}: Me again! I'll count this as a second wish. Or a {{occasion.payload.copies:ordinal}}.
</beat>

<beat id="ariaTap" on="homeTap" target="hero.aria" once="day">
  @aria: Seventeen stars came out last night. I named four of them after you. Is that weird?
  @aria{when="@weekend"}: It's the weekend! Stars don't take weekends. I asked.
</beat>

<beat id="ariaBirthday" on="dailyReset" once="day" when="holds(celebrate(aria))">
  @aria{emotion="surprised"}: You remembered my birthday? I didn't even tell the stars.
</beat>

<beat use="bondStory" id="ariaR1" who="aria" rank="r1" vow="Now I count you too. Don't go missing.">
  @aria: Can I tell you why I count stars?
  @aria: When I was small, the sky went dark for a whole winter. The Hollow King was hungry.
  @aria{emotion="sad"}: I counted the ones that were left. Every night. So none could go missing without someone noticing.
</beat>

<beat use="bondStory" id="ariaR2" who="aria" rank="r2" prev="bonds.aria.ariaR1" vow="I'll keep calling. You keep answering.">
  @aria: I tried to call a star for you tonight. The brightest one.
  @aria{emotion="sad"}: It didn't come. Maybe I'm not as good as they say.
  <branch id="ariaR2Answer" prompt="Aria looks at her hands.">
    <choice id="stayed" label="You called me. I stayed.">
      @aria{emotion="shy"}: ...That's a really unfair thing to say. Thank you.
    </choice>
    <choice id="tomorrow" label="Try again tomorrow. I'll watch.">
      @aria{emotion="happy"}: Tomorrow, then. Bring a blanket. The roof is cold.
    </choice>
  </branch>
</beat>

<beat use="bondStory" id="ariaR3" who="aria" rank="r3" prev="bonds.aria.ariaR2" vow="Starcaller Aria, sworn to you. Every night.">
  @aria: I finally counted all of them. Every star the Hollow King took, we've brought back.
  @aria{emotion="surprised"}: Except one. There's a gap, just there, low in the east.
  @aria{emotion="happy"}: I think I'll leave it empty. It's shaped like the day I met you.
</beat>
